#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add System Tools to the logo menu"
msgstr "Pridėti „Sistemos įrankius“ į logotipo meniu"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add six more topics to the EvenKeelOS guide"
msgstr "Pridėti dar šešias temas į EvenKeelOS vadovą"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Turn New to Linux into the EvenKeelOS guide"
msgstr "Paversti „Naujam Linux“ vadovą EvenKeelOS vadovu"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add the New to Linux guide in System Tools and at login"
msgstr "Pridėti vadovą „Naujam Linux“ į „Sistemos įrankius“ ir prisijungimo metu"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Boot options: common fixes and your own settings"
msgstr "Pridėti „Įkrovos parinktis“: dažni pataisymai ir jūsų pačių nustatymai"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix the Shared folders build check: no home folders yet"
msgstr "Pataisyti „Bendrinamų aplankų“ darinio patikrą: namų aplankų dar nėra"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Shared folders: share home folders on Home networks"
msgstr "Pridėti „Bendrinamus aplankus“: bendrinti namų aplankus tinkluose „Namai“"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Network safety: Home, Work or Public place"
msgstr "Pridėti „Tinklo saugą“: Namai, Darbas arba Viešoji vieta"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Recognize printer drivers in any folder"
msgstr "Atpažinti spausdintuvų tvarkykles bet kuriame aplanke"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Show tool windows inside System Tools"
msgstr "Rodyti įrankių langus „Sistemos įrankių“ viduje"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Open an issue when the image build fails"
msgstr "Atidaryti problemos pranešimą, kai nepavyksta sukurti atvaizdo"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Lock outside packages and the ISO tool to exact versions"
msgstr "Užfiksuoti išorinius paketus ir ISO įrankį tiksliose versijose"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Name tool windows after the tool, shorter test list"
msgstr "Pavadinti įrankių langus pagal įrankį, trumpesnis bandymų sąrašas"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Repair deleted system settings and alert on certificates"
msgstr "Pataisyti ištrintus sistemos nustatymus ir įspėti apie sertifikatus"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Put every tool in one System Tools window"
msgstr "Sudėti visus įrankius į vieną „Sistemos įrankių“ langą"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Leave nothing behind when a VPN is removed"
msgstr "Nieko nepalikti pašalinus VPN"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Get a VPN, with VPNs that keep updating"
msgstr "Pridėti „Gauti VPN“ su nuolat atnaujinamais VPN"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Give Zoom meetings their own guide"
msgstr "Sukurti „Zoom“ susitikimams atskirą vadovą"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Open Zoom meetings in Chrome, in Zoom's web version"
msgstr "Atidaryti „Zoom“ susitikimus „Chrome“, „Zoom“ žiniatinklio versijoje"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Stop ArtCraft installs from breaking Flathub installs"
msgstr "Neleisti „ArtCraft“ diegimams sugadinti „Flathub“ diegimų"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Recognize installers by their usual file name"
msgstr "Atpažinti diegimo programas pagal įprastą failo pavadinimą"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer Linux replacements for Windows programs"
msgstr "Siūlyti Linux pakaitalus „Windows“ programoms"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix box setup: distrobox mounts read-only folders wrong"
msgstr "Pataisyti dėžės sąranką: distrobox neteisingai prijungia tik skaitomus aplankus"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer Fedora or Ubuntu versions of Windows programs"
msgstr "Siūlyti „Windows“ programų „Fedora“ arba „Ubuntu“ versijas"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer the Linux version when a Windows program is opened"
msgstr "Siūlyti Linux versiją, kai atidaroma „Windows“ programa"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Ship one shim, so firmware adds no extra Fedora entry"
msgstr "Pateikti vieną shim, kad programinė įranga nepridėtų papildomo „Fedora“ įrašo"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Put Fedora's firewall zone back"
msgstr "Grąžinti „Fedora“ užkardos zoną"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Harden root helpers, firewall and no-password updates"
msgstr "Sustiprinti root pagalbininkus, užkardą ir naujinimus be slaptažodžio"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "New defaults: wallpapers, accent folders, lock screen"
msgstr "Naujos numatytosios reikšmės: fonai, akcento spalvos aplankai, užrakinimo ekranas"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "New default: teal accent color, also on the login screen"
msgstr "Nauja numatytoji reikšmė: žalsvai mėlyna akcento spalva, taip pat prisijungimo ekrane"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix rollback note, login-loop and stuck tests"
msgstr "Pataisyti grąžinimo pastabą, prisijungimo ciklą ir strigusius bandymus"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix freeze rollback and cut retries to 2"
msgstr "Pataisyti grąžinimą po užstrigimo ir sumažinti bandymų skaičių iki 2"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix the automatic rollback tests"
msgstr "Pataisyti automatinio grąžinimo bandymus"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Real failure tests for automatic rollback"
msgstr "Tikri gedimų bandymai automatiniam grąžinimui"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add automatic rollback with greenboot"
msgstr "Pridėti automatinį grąžinimą su greenboot"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Start the Windows layout on the desktop, plus small fixes"
msgstr "Paleisti „Windows“ išdėstymą darbalaukyje, ir smulkūs pataisymai"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Pause automatic updates for 3 days after an undo"
msgstr "Pristabdyti automatinius naujinimus 3 dienoms po atšaukimo"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add a Desktop layout step to the installer"
msgstr "Pridėti „Darbalaukio išdėstymo“ žingsnį į diegimo programą"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Desktop layout to System Tools"
msgstr "Pridėti „Darbalaukio išdėstymą“ į „Sistemos įrankius“"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Keep power-mode switches from waiting on updates"
msgstr "Neleisti energijos režimo keitimui laukti naujinimų"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add an optional Windows-style layout"
msgstr "Pridėti pasirenkamą „Windows“ stiliaus išdėstymą"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix Fedora 45 presets and container policy paths"
msgstr "Pataisyti „Fedora 45“ išankstinius nustatymus ir konteinerių politikos kelius"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Read download sources in Fedora 45's new folder"
msgstr "Skaityti atsisiuntimo šaltinius naujame „Fedora 45“ aplanke"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Move to Fedora 45"
msgstr "Pereiti prie „Fedora 45“"
